      "Priority Rules: added explicit demotion signals for (a) boundaries that split a noun head from an immediate postnominal modifier/apposition within the next ~3 tokens, (b) boundaries immediately after a colon that introduces a clause completing or qualifying the prior assertion, and (c) candidates that are clustered within three source words of another candidate without intervening strong punctuation — these are ranking signals, not prohibitions.",
